OL,3,GNEWSAHospital failings laid bare in
OL,4,Adamning report
OL,5,
OL,6,FRecords show a hospital trust is "among
OL,7,Fthe worst in England" for people
OL,8,Fspending more than 12 hours in the
OL,9,Femergency department.
OL,11,FMore than 900 people faced stays of
OL,12,Fsuch length in the month prior to a
OL,13,Fdamning inspection.
OL,15,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC) has
OL,16,Fdowngraded urgent and emergency care at
OL,17,FRoyal Albert Edward Infirmary in Wigan,
OL,18,FGreater Manchester, after several
OL,19,Fconcerns were raised over patient care.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
